        "cooked": "<p>It depends upon what is going on currently, &nbsp;if Bunker got incapped and you don't want him coming back up to immediately play Turret Mode I would suggest placing Blazing Tornado on his hex. &nbsp; Doesn't mean he might not still play Turret mode when he comes up but it might make him hesitant about it. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
